THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

The PBR rock and terrain textures under `src/assets/textures/` are downloaded
from Poly Haven (https://polyhaven.com) and are released under the CC0 1.0
Universal Public Domain Dedication.

The scanned geological figures under `src/图件/` and the reference imagery under
`素材库/` are project data and are NOT covered by this license. They are
excluded from the repository; see docs/DATA-SETUP.md for how to obtain them.

Third-party JavaScript and Python dependencies retain their own licenses. See
package-lock.json and backend/requirements.txt.
